Worksheet 3: Reading & Writing
Title: English Worksheet 3 - Reading Comprehension
Reading Passage: Phuket is one of the most popular islands in Thailand. It has beautiful white sand beaches, clear blue sea, and many exciting activities. Many tourists from around the world visit Phuket every year. Thai people are very friendly and love to help tourists.
Questions:
1.  Where is Phuket?
2.  What can tourists see and do in Phuket?
3.  Why do many people like to visit Phuket?
Writing Task: Would you like to visit Phuket? Why or why not?
Write at least 6-8 sentences.